# Never commit the real gateway secrets — on prod they come from GH Actions secrets, staged
# into .env by deploy-litellm.yml (ADR-115 Option A); .env.example documents the slots.
.env
# Minted virtual keys written on the box by deploy-litellm.sh / manual mint (e.g.
# .proj-podcast-prod.key). Plaintext consumer keys — never in git.
*.key
